	"name": "Split",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-dripping-purple.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your ability to control your component selves increases dramatically, allowing you to split your consciousness across two selves each with half your current HP. You must be at Medium size to use this ability, but divide yourself into two Small selves. Each Small version of you gets to move on your initiative up to 25ft. But your action, any bonus action, and reaction are split between the two selves.</p><p>While split in this way, you may partake in two journey or downtime activities at the same time. One can take a long rest while the other keeps watch and so forth. If one of your selves is killed, the other can regrow during a long rest in a safe haven as described in the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-heritage-features.Item.eXu1sAo7bJbh6BuD]{Shedding} heritage trait.</p><p>You can use this ability for a total of 8 hours spent in 1 hour increments and recover all use of the ability at the end of a long rest.</p>",
